OL,5,G2115 The Staircase
OL,6,     FWhen businesswoman Kathleen
OL,7,     FPeterson is found dead after
OL,8,     Freportedly falling down a flight
OL,9,     Fof stairs at her North Carolina
OL,10,     Fhome, the unusually bloody scene
OL,11,     Fleads police to focus their
OL,12,     Fattention on her husband, author
OL,13,     Fand aspiring local politician
OL,14,     FMichael Peterson. While the
OL,15,     FPetersons' blended family rallies
OL,16,     Faround the patriarch, the
OL,17,     Finvestigation quickly zeroes in on
OL,18,     FMichael's secret life, calling the
OL,19,     Fcouple's seemingly picture perfect
OL,20,     Fmarriage into question. Fact-based
OL,21,     Fdrama, starring Colin Firth and
OL,22,     FToni Collette
