OL,5,G2230 The Staircase
OL,6,     FAfter posting bail, Michael and
OL,7,     Fhis high-powered attorney David
OL,8,     FRudolf piece together their
OL,9,     Fdefence, while considering an
OL,10,     Foffer from Jean-Xavier de
OL,11,     FLestrade, a French documentarian
OL,12,     Feager to profile the case. As
OL,13,     Fteams of forensic experts on both
OL,14,     Fsides recreate the night of
OL,15,     FKathleen's death, Michael's
OL,16,     Fchildren grapple with shocking new
OL,17,     Finformation about their father,
OL,18,     Fwhile his stepdaughter Caitlin
OL,19,     Fwrestles with her own doubts
